References: <tTtH1_3NTJw.Qe8Bt6juAQAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/distance-sampling/c/tTtH1_3NTJw/m/j05vaK3vAQAJ>
