Hello, I am doing a study on the monitoring of small mammals using camera traps and live traps. I would like to use the functions (Mark Recapture Distance Sampling, and Camera Trap Distance Sampling) of the distance tool for the analysis of my data. I would like to have documentation concerning these functions. I would also like to have examples of data on this subject. THANKS

