Abdou-Wakilou

If you are using the R package Distance for the analysis of your camera trapping data, there is a sample data set included with the package. There is a step-by-step analysis of that data set at this web site:

http://examples.distancesampling.org/Distance-cameratraps/camera-distill.html
Analysis of camera trapping data <http://examples.distancesampling.org/Distance-cameratraps/camera-distill.html>
Example analysis with Ivory Coast Maxwell's duiker.
examples.distancesampling.org <http://examples.distancesampling.org>
If you are using Distance for Windows, there is a project called DuikerDaytime​ that is shipped as part of the Sample Projects for that software.

Hope this is helpful.
